    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO PickUpObject\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO MoveObjectToDestination\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectLight? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO InspectObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
